scripts/thesis_a_p1_discrete_search_v2.py finished (86-min real run, internal
RTX 3090). Verdict: thesis_a_p1_v2_INCONCLUSIVE — AR positive control best
exact-match 0.010, below the 0.3 floor needed to adjudicate ARTIFACT vs
FUNDAMENTAL. EBT decode paths (argmin/descent/beam) degenerate ("7777"-class
output). n_train=40000 fix did NOT rescue the control: 4-digit EXACT-match
addition from a tiny from-scratch model is too hard for any method to reach a
non-degenerate reference, so this harness cannot adjudicate energy-as-generator.

The adversarial-verify CRITICAL flags are TAUTOLOGY false-positives by
degeneracy: ar_greedy=ar_selfconsistency=ar_best=0.01 agree only because all
three collapse onto the same single correct answer out of 100 (1/100
quantization), not because two distinct measurements are bit-identical by a bug.
The 5155s duration rules out fabrication. Honest INCONCLUSIVE, not a fake.

Does NOT change the bounded conclusion: energy selection/generation stays
honest-negative-bounded (P0.1/Thesis-A). This discrete-search harness is simply
unable to sharpen it — 3 INCONCLUSIVE runs. Retire-or-redesign is operator's call
(stronger/pretrained AR, partial-credit metric, or easier corpus).

